RT CONTRACT FOR THE TRICARE EAST REGION BY THE DEFENSE HEALTH AGENCY OF THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE (DOD). TRICARE IS THE MILITARY HEALTH CARE PROGRAM THAT PROVIDES BENEFITS TO MILITARY SERVICE MEMBERS, RETIREES AND THEIR FAMILIES.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2022-12-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'MEDIA ALERT: INTEL HOSTS 4TH GEN XEON SCALABLE AND MAX SERIES LAUNCH', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ON JAN. 10, INTEL WILL OFFICIALLY WELCOME TO MARKET THE 4TH GEN INTEL® XEON® SCALABLE PROCESSORS AND THE INTEL XEON CPU MAX SERIES, AS WELL AS THE INTEL DATA CENTER GPU MAX SERIES FOR HIGH PERFORMANCE COMPUTING (HPC) AND AI.'}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2022-12-22 08:50:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF ABIOMED', 'text': "NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ), THE WORLD'S LARGEST, MOST DIVERSIFIED HEALTHCARE PRODUCTS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF ABIOMED, INC. ABIOMED IS NOW PART OF JOHNSON & JOHNSON AND WILL OPERATE AS A STANDALONE BUSINESS WITHIN JOHNSON & JOHNSON'S MEDTECH SEGMENT."}{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2022-12-22 08:10:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS ANNOUNCES DIVESTITURE OF VISUAL INFORMATION SOLUTIONS BUSINESS', 'text': 'MELBOURNE, FLA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LHX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SIGNING OF A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT WITH NV5 GLOBAL INC. (NASDAQ: NVEE) TO DIVEST ITS VISUAL INFORMATION SOLUTIONS BUSINESS WITH AN ANTICIPATED BENEFIT UP TO $100 MILLION. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE MID-2023, SUBJECT TO REQUIRED REGULATORY APPROVALS AND OTHER CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2022-12-22 06:45:00', 'title': 'MERCK AND KELUN-BIOTECH ANNOUNCE EXCLUSIVE LICENSE AND COLLABORATION AGREEMENT FOR SEVEN INVESTIGATIONAL ANTIBODY-DRUG CONJUGATE CANDIDATES FOR THE TREATMENT OF CANCER', 'text': 'RAHWAY, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MERCK (NYSE: MRK), KNOWN AS MSD OUTSIDE OF THE UNITED STATES AND CANADA, AND KELUN-BIOTECH (A HOLDING S